00:29:36.049 --> 00:29:41.049
don't honor the promise that you've made to my son, or I find out you've told anyone about this conversation.

00:29:41.049 --> 00:30:20.789
I will kill Clark.

00:30:20.789 --> 00:30:21.789
She didn't tell you anything?

00:30:21.789 --> 00:30:24.789
No, she just vanished. She won't answer herself.

00:30:24.789 --> 00:30:38.140
Sorry, Alex, I don't know what to say, but I'm sure there's an explanation for all of this.

00:30:38.140 --> 00:30:41.140
Father, did Lana say anything to you?

00:30:41.140 --> 00:30:43.140
Anything that might have indicated?

00:30:43.140 --> 00:30:46.140
Be patient, Lex. Give her a little more time.

00:30:46.140 --> 00:31:07.289
But in danger, so to be expected.

00:31:07.289 --> 00:31:21.339
I've loved you.

00:31:21.339 --> 00:31:26.740
Since the first moment I saw you, will you marry me?

00:31:26.740 --> 00:33:08.869
Alexander Luther, take Lana Lang to be your wife in the holy state of matrimony.

00:33:08.869 --> 00:33:14.869
Do you promise to love her, comfort her, honor and keep her,

00:33:14.869 --> 00:33:18.869
in sickness and in health, for richer, for poorer,

00:33:18.869 --> 00:33:38.650
and forsaking all others as long as you both shall live?

00:33:38.650 --> 00:33:42.650
And do you, Lana Lang, take Alexander Luther to be your husband

00:33:42.650 --> 00:33:44.650
in the holy state of matrimony?

00:33:44.650 --> 00:33:48.650
Do you promise to love him, comfort him,

00:33:48.650 --> 00:33:53.650
honor and keep him in sickness and in health,

00:33:53.650 --> 00:33:55.650
for richer, for poorer,

00:33:55.650 --> 00:33:59.650
and forsaking all others as long as you both shall live?

00:33:59.650 --> 00:34:04.940
I do.

00:34:04.940 --> 00:34:32.820
May I present to you Mr. and Mrs. Alexander Luther.

00:34:32.820 --> 00:35:15.900
I never thought it was possible to be this happy.

00:35:15.900 --> 00:35:21.889
How did I ever turn out to be the man who gets to spend the rest of his life with you,

00:35:21.889 --> 00:35:30.829
Mrs. Luther?

00:35:30.829 --> 00:35:47.420
I'll be right there.

00:35:47.420 --> 00:35:57.030
I waited for you.

00:35:57.030 --> 00:35:59.030
Clark.

00:35:59.030 --> 00:36:01.630
What happened?

00:36:01.630 --> 00:36:06.599
I'm really sorry.

00:36:06.599 --> 00:36:08.599
I didn't mean to hurt you.

00:36:08.599 --> 00:36:11.599
But I want to be with Lex.

00:36:11.599 --> 00:36:19.809
He got you, didn't he?

00:36:19.809 --> 00:36:22.809
No, please just believe me and let it go.

00:36:22.809 --> 00:36:24.809
Let it go?

00:36:24.809 --> 00:36:30.849
Let it go. Lana, I love you.

00:36:30.849 --> 00:36:31.849
I love you.

00:36:31.849 --> 00:36:32.849
Clark, don't.

00:36:32.849 --> 00:36:34.849
Tell me what he did.

00:36:34.849 --> 00:36:36.849
What did Lex do? You don't have to stay with him.

00:36:36.849 --> 00:36:38.849
He didn't do anything. I've made my decision.

00:36:38.849 --> 00:36:40.849
I just want to be with him.

00:36:40.849 --> 00:36:45.800
Why do you keep saying that?

00:36:45.800 --> 00:36:49.500
Lana, we should be together.

00:36:49.500 --> 00:36:52.500
I want this more than I've ever wanted anything.

00:36:52.500 --> 00:36:54.500
And I know that you do, too.

00:36:54.500 --> 00:37:09.739
I've had a change of heart.

00:37:09.739 --> 00:37:10.739
You don't mean that.

00:37:10.739 --> 00:37:16.260
Is this because of my secret?

00:37:16.260 --> 00:37:18.260
Lana, I'll tell you.

00:37:18.260 --> 00:37:21.260
I'm not like everyone else.

00:37:21.260 --> 00:37:22.260
I'm...

00:37:22.260 --> 00:37:23.260
No, Clark, you have to go.

00:37:23.260 --> 00:37:24.260
No.

00:37:24.260 --> 00:37:25.260
No.

00:37:25.260 --> 00:37:27.539
No.

00:37:27.539 --> 00:37:28.539
Not until you look me in the eye.

00:37:28.539 --> 00:37:29.539
You tell me.

00:37:29.539 --> 00:37:34.539
You'd rather spend the rest of your life with Lex Luther instead of me.

00:37:34.539 --> 00:37:42.889
I'm sorry, Clark. I love Lex.

00:37:42.889 --> 00:38:13.460
Congratulations, son.

00:38:13.460 --> 00:38:15.460
Thanks, Dad.

00:38:15.460 --> 00:38:18.460
And why do I get the feeling that's not all you came to say?

00:38:18.460 --> 00:38:23.460
Good to see the euphoria of your wedding day hasn't tempered your cynicism.

00:38:23.460 --> 00:38:25.460
I guess old habits die hard.

00:38:25.460 --> 00:38:29.460
And apparently, some are next to impossible to kill, aren't they?

00:38:29.460 --> 00:38:35.730
Do you sit up at night practicing this stuff?

00:38:35.730 --> 00:38:38.730
How could you be so stupid?

00:38:38.730 --> 00:38:41.730
A grown man on his wedding day,

00:38:41.730 --> 00:38:43.730
and you need me to come to the rescue again.

00:38:43.730 --> 00:38:45.730
You are pathetic.

00:38:45.730 --> 00:38:47.730
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:38:47.730 --> 00:38:49.730
Don't play the fool with me, Lex.

00:38:49.730 --> 00:38:51.730
There's a crypt down below

00:38:51.730 --> 00:38:54.730
that has gotten a little overcrowded.

00:38:54.730 --> 00:39:05.360
It's an accident.

00:39:05.360 --> 00:39:06.360
Of course it was.

00:39:06.360 --> 00:39:08.360
You don't have the guts to plan a successful murder.

00:39:08.360 --> 00:39:10.360
And if anyone should discover

00:39:10.360 --> 00:39:14.360
that the fresh corpse downstairs happens to be that of your bride's physician,

00:39:14.360 --> 00:39:15.360
they just don't.

00:39:15.360 --> 00:39:19.360
might stumble onto the truth about Lana's pregnancy.

00:39:19.360 --> 00:39:32.769
He's made a desperate man of you, Lex.

00:39:32.769 --> 00:39:35.150
You win.

00:39:35.150 --> 00:39:37.150
Whatever you want, it's yours.

00:39:37.150 --> 00:39:39.150
Control of Luther Corp 33.1.

00:39:39.150 --> 00:39:40.150
You don't have to worry, Lex.

00:39:40.150 --> 00:39:53.159
You'll know when it's time for me to collect.

00:39:53.159 --> 00:39:55.159
Sorry, I didn't mean to interrupt.

00:39:55.159 --> 00:40:18.889
Welcome to the family.

00:40:18.889 --> 00:40:27.849
Got no trouble today with anyone.

00:40:27.849 --> 00:40:53.760
It's enough for me.

00:40:53.760 --> 00:40:55.760
It's enough for me.

